														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1234305">
									

<p>Neutral vote from me, since it is an OTT roller coaster, and yes, cliches can be done well, but the lack of explanation why the foundation determined this particular coaster was anomalous kinda bugs me. It reads like people just reported hating the ride, and the company went out of business, so the foundation bought it to find out why people hated the ride.</p>
<p>The writing is good, except for those couple of nitpicks, so no down vote.</p>

