			<div class="content" id="post-content-1234486">
									

<p>Actually, I'd say this does hit the OTT cliche but it does it just right. This is basically a super-duper roller coaster at its heart, the riders are locked in and helpless until the ride is over and all they experience is a roller coaster.</p>
<p>And that's pretty terrifying, it would stop being fun pretty quickly and just keep going and going and going&#8230; eight days of torture or more in a three minute ride.</p>

